# Simple Structural Proof of P=NP and Disproof of ZFC under Total Connectedness

**Author:** Johannes Geisen (@OverThePlaces / @frintroper)  
**Framework:** TONE  
**License:** RIPL v1.0

Structural proof that total connectedness of all processes (including meta-levels) forces the degenerate truth of P=NP and the structural failure of the empty-set axiom and the axiom of choice. A single disconnection restores classical structure.

Main files: `paper.tex`, `Framework.lean`, `simulation.py`
